    <string name="attribution_derived_terms_title">Jitendex and derived data terms</string>
    <string name="attribution_derived_terms">Jitendex is shared under CC BY-SA 4.0. Its JMdict/JMnedict data is provided by the Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group under the EDRDG licence. Tatoeba examples are CC BY 2.0 FR, Kanji alive audio is CC BY 4.0, and JmdictFurigana is CC BY-SA 4.0. Follow the source URLs below for the complete terms and contributor records.</string>
    <string name="attribution_jisho_title">Jisho network privacy notice</string>
    <string name="attribution_jisho_disclosure">Jisho is disabled by default. If you enable it in Settings and the engine reaches the Jisho fallback, Japanese lookup terms derived from your subtitles are sent to https://jisho.org. Video, audio, subtitle files, sentences, Anki collection data, and account identifiers are not sent by this fallback.</string>
    <string name="attribution_jisho_rate_limit">Android enforces at least one second between Jisho requests. Disable Jisho to keep definition lookup fully offline.</string>
